### Health (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/health

### KIS exact OCR
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/search/kis
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"\"Gừng cay muối mặn\"","top_k":10,"debug":true}

### Ordered sequence
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/search/sequence
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"cào muối, sau đó vẫy tay, cuối cùng đứng trước căn nhà","top_k":10}

### VQA evidence-first
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/vqa
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Dòng chữ trên căn nhà là gì?","top_k_evidence":5}
